  {
    "id": 2,
    "name": "Incident Postmortem (Template)",
    "project_id": 1,
    "description_html": "<p xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">A blameless postmortem. Focus on what happened and what changes, not who to blame. Copy this page for each incident.</p><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" class=\"py-4 border-strong-1\" data-type=\"horizontalRule\"><div></div></div><h2 xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" class=\"editor-heading-block\"><span data-name=\"memo\" data-type=\"emoji\">📝</span> Summary</h2><p xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">What happened, in two or three sentences. Include the customer impact.</p><h2 xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" class=\"editor-heading-block\"><span data-name=\"chart\" data-type=\"emoji\">📉</span> Impact</h2><ul xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" class=\"list-disc pl-7 space-y-(--list-spacing-y)\" data-tight=\"false\"><li class=\"not-prose space-y-2\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">Services affected</p></li><li class=\"not-prose space-y-2\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">Duration (start → end)</p></li><li class=\"not-prose space-y-2\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">Customers affected</p></li><li class=\"not-prose space-y-2\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">Linked work items</p></li></ul><h2 xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" class=\"editor-heading-block\"><span data-name=\"clock\" data-type=\"emoji\">🕒</span> Timeline</h2><table xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><tbody><tr style=\"\"><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" background=\"none\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"background-color: none;\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">Time</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"666\" background=\"none\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"background-color: none;\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">Event</p></th></tr><tr style=\"\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\"><strong>Detection</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"666\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">When monitoring or a customer first flagged it</p></td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\"><strong>First response</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"666\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">Who picked it up and what they tried</p></td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\"><strong>Mitigation</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"666\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">What stopped the impact</p></td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\"><strong>Resolution</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"666\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">What fixed it for good</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" class=\"editor-heading-block\"><span data-name=\"mag\" data-type=\"emoji\">🔍</span> Root cause</h2><p xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">What actually failed — include contributing factors, not just the trigger.</p><h2 xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" class=\"editor-heading-block\"><span data-name=\"white_check\" data-type=\"emoji\">✅</span> What went well</h2><ul xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" class=\"list-disc pl-7 space-y-(--list-spacing-y)\" data-tight=\"false\"><li class=\"not-prose space-y-2\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">What worked in detection, response, or communication?</p></li></ul><h2 xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" class=\"editor-heading-block\"><span data-name=\"fire\" data-type=\"emoji\">🧯</span> Action items</h2><table xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><tbody><tr style=\"\"><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" background=\"none\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"background-color: none;\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">Action</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" background=\"none\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"background-color: none;\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">Owner</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" background=\"none\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"background-color: none;\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">Due</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" background=\"none\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"background-color: none;\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">Work item</p></th></tr><tr style=\"\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">Add an alert for the failing dependency</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">Service owner</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">Within 2 weeks</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">Link the work item</p></td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">Document the recovery step in the runbook</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">On-call engineer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">Within 1 week</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"150\" hidecontent=\"false\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><p class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">Link the work item</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" class=\"editor-paragraph-block\">File action items as work items and link them here so follow-up doesn't get lost.</p>",
    "description_stripped": "Blameless postmortem template: summary, impact, timeline, root cause, and action items.",
    "type": "PROJECT",
    "access": 1,
    "logo_props": "{\"emoji\": {\"url\": \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/emoji-datasource-apple/img/apple/64/1f9f1.png\", \"value\": \"129521\"}, \"in_use\": \"emoji\"}"
  }
]
